1
00:00:00,560 --> 00:00:04,560
When it comes to Mars, everyone thought we were crazy.

2
00:00:05,560 --> 00:00:09,560
But sometimes, that's what it takes.

3
00:00:09,560 --> 00:00:13,560
We're making science fiction reality.

4
00:00:13,560 --> 00:00:18,560
Writing the next chapters in the story of Mars exploration.

5
00:00:19,560 --> 00:00:22,560
But it doesn't happen overnight.

6
00:00:22,560 --> 00:00:24,560
Getting there is never easy.

7
00:00:24,560 --> 00:00:28,560
The first powered flight by an aircraft on another planet.

8
00:00:28,560 --> 00:00:30,560
It takes courage.

9
00:00:31,560 --> 00:00:33,560
Creativity.

10
00:00:33,560 --> 00:00:35,560
Resilience.

11
00:00:35,560 --> 00:00:39,560
It takes a legacy of daring, mighty things.

12
00:00:40,560 --> 00:00:46,690
A failing.

13
00:00:48,690 --> 00:00:51,690
And picking ourselves back up.

14
00:00:51,690 --> 00:00:53,690
We've been here before.

15
00:00:53,690 --> 00:00:56,690
Decades of success.

16
00:00:56,690 --> 00:01:00,690
Building the future isn't for everyone.

17
00:01:00,690 --> 00:01:03,690
But for us, it's written in our DNA.

18
00:01:03,690 --> 00:01:07,690
We are the architects of the impossible.

19
00:01:07,690 --> 00:01:12,690
And on Mars, we've only just begun.

